mapping "R068A.1" source="R068A" target="78275009" relationship=source_is_broader_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source R068A SNOMED CT 78275009 = Obstructive sleep-related breathing disorder (Swedish SE
        extension of R06.8). OSDB is a broad umbrella spanning simple snoring through obstructive sleep
        apnea/hypopnea in adults and children. No exact OSDB standard concept exists in the mirror; the
        dominant clinically-coded target is (concept_id 442588) = Obstructive sleep apnea syndrome,
        standard=S. SNOMED CT 386813002 (Abnormal breathing, the WHO R06.8 crosswalk target, concept_id
        4305080) is broader still. Chose 78275009 as the clinically-actionable narrower target since
        OSDB in Swedish practice usually denotes the OSA end of the spectrum. : forced narrower mapping;
        the source is broader than OSAS.
        """
}
